======================     =========================  ========================================================
`None` (default)           Frobenius norm             `2`-norm (see below)
`'fro'`                    Frobenius norm             -- not supported --
`'nuc'`                    nuclear norm               -- not supported --
`inf`                      `max(sum(abs(x), dim=1))`  `max(abs(x))`
`-inf`                     `min(sum(abs(x), dim=1))`  `min(abs(x))`
`0`                        -- not supported --        `sum(x != 0)`
