Using the :attr:`dim` argument to compute vector norms::

    >>> c = torch.tensor([[1., 2., 3.],
    ...                   [-1, 1, 4]])
    >>> LA.norm(c, dim=0)
    tensor([1.4142, 2.2361, 5.0000])
